  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-CELAC Summit 2025 Colombia. Side events and GGIA preparatory actions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This action wiil provide support to the organisation of side events and preparatory works with concerned countries/groups of countries in the advancement of the GGIA implementation at the EU-CELAC Summit 2025 to be held in Colombia and hosted by the Colombian authorities.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
